---
description: Strict import direction rules for the nav-gauge monorepo
globs: "*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Import sequence: `tinker-chest` → `ui/{common,web,mobile}` → `apparatus/{common,web,mobile}` → `gears/*/{common,web,mobile}` → `app-{web,mobile}`
- Never import reverse (e.g. apparatus importing from gears)
- Always use `@package-name` aliases, never relative paths across workspaces

### Package locations

| Package | Path |
|---------|------|
| Tinker Chest | `/tinker-chest/` |
| UI Common | `/ui/common/` |
| UI Web | `/ui/web/` |
| UI Mobile | `/ui/mobile/` |
| Apparatus Common | `/apparatus/common/` |
| Apparatus Web | `/apparatus/web/` |
| Apparatus Mobile | `/apparatus/mobile/` |
| Gears | `/gears/*/{common,web,mobile}/` |

### Allowed importers

| Package | Can be imported by |
|---------|-------------------|
| Tinker Chest | Apparatus (all), Gears, Apps, UI (all) |
| Apparatus Common | Apparatus Web/Mobile, Gears, Apps — NOT UI, NOT Tinker Chest |
| Apparatus Web | Gear Web, App Web |
| Apparatus Mobile | Gear Mobile, App Mobile |
| UI Common | ALL modules |
| UI Web | Gear Web, App Web |
| UI Mobile | Gear Mobile, App Mobile |
